DESCRIPTION:Category: Member Mixer\nPrice: Free / Included\nStatus: You are
  Confirmed\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/188062\n\nJ
 oin fellow members for a relaxing sunset kayak along the scenic Charles Ri
 ver. Enjoy the great outdoors\, while connecting with fellow members\, and
  taking in stunning views of the Boston skyline from a fresh vantage. Host
 ed by The 'Quin Membership Team\, please look forward to gathering on land
  at 5:00PM at Paddle Boston for a casual mingle\, outfitting\, and a brief
  orientation before getting on the water at 5:30PM. Kayaks will be provide
 d\, and all experience levels are welcome.\n\n*This event is complimentary
  and reserved for member only. All attendees will be required to sign a wa
 iver prior to kayaking. This event is weather permitting\; a rain date wil
 l be offered if necessary.
